 ww.maine.gov/dhhs/oms/rules/index.shtml.\n________________________________
 ____________________________________________\nNotice of Agency Rulemaking 
 Proposal\nAGENCY:\nDepartment of Health and Human Services\, Office of Mai
 neCare Services\, Division of Policy\nCHAPTER NUMBER AND RULE TITLE:\n10-1
 44 C.M.R. Ch. 101\, MaineCare Benefits Manual (MBM)\, Ch. III\, Sec. 20\, 
 Allowances for Home and Community-Based Services for Adults with Other Rel
 ated Conditions\nTYPE OF RULE:\nMajor Substantive\nBRIEF SUMMARY:\nSection
  20 in the MBM authorizes home and community-based services (HCBS) under a
  CMS-approved Section 1915(c) waiver. The Department proposes to amend the
  Chapter III\, Section 20 rule to establish the reimbursement methodology 
 for new services being added under a companion\, Chapter II\, Section 20 r
 ule\, and to remove rates of reimbursement for all services which will now
  be listed in Rate Schedules on the Department’s website pursuant to 22 
 M.R.S. § 3177-J. The website address for current rates of reimbursement i
 n the D\nhttps://www.maine.gov/dhhs/oms/providers/provider-bulletins/maine
 care-notice-agency-rule-making-proposal-mainecare-benefits-manual-chapter-
 iii-3
URL:https://www.maine.gov/dhhs/oms/providers/provider-bulletins/mainecare-
 notice-agency-rule-making-proposal-mainecare-benefits-manual-chapter-iii-3
